        analogy: 'This mirrors the scientific method applied to prompt design: form a hypothesis (this prompt should work), test it (run it against real inputs), observe results, and refine based on evidence — not guesswork.',
        example: 'Version 1 of a summarization prompt produces summaries that are too long. Observation: max_tokens and length instructions are insufficient. Refinement: add an explicit word count target and a few-shot example of the correct length.',
